<Respond to the Question 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nSusan recently put herself on the job market and applied for many jobs. Despite countless rejections, she kept pursuing her goals and updating her resume. Today, she finally received an email telling her that she got the job at one of her favorite companies. Upon seeing the offer, she started crying. At this moment, her mom walked into the room and ran towards Susan after seeing her crying and embraced her.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would Susan's Mom ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Nervousness & Curiosity\nB) Delight & Embarrassment\nC) Delight & Hopeless\nD) Delight & Curiosity\nE) Relief & Curiosity\nF) Delight & Nervousness\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would Susan's Mom feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) She wants to know what made her daughter cry & She was nervous about her own upcoming job interview and was curious if Susan could offer any insight\nB) She wants to know what made her daughter cry & She had just lost her own job and was wondering if Susan had received a job offer\nC) She was worried about her daughter crying & She was happy for her daughter's success in her job search\nD) She was worried about her daughter crying & She wants to know what made her daughter cry\nE) She was nervous about her own upcoming job interview and was curious if Susan could offer any insight & Her daughter had accomplished something she couldn't\nF) She was worried about her daughter crying & She had just lost her own job and was wondering if Susan had received a job offer","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0de9aa9dc5a833d929a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482398877,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:58","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"8480a072dc1f468e8f7b63e263508dc5"}